# BDJ_DISC_A (local disc): the main menu, then PLAY. Playlist 00149 plays behind the menu; PLAY plays two short
# playlists (01048, 00100), then BD-J title 1 starts the feature, playlist 00040.
wait playlist 149
wait still 1500   # the main menu has faded in, PLAY focused
key ok            # PLAY
wait playlist 40  # the feature
